  "id": "learning-to-learn",
  "term": "learning to learn",
  "definition": "Learning to learn is the process by which knowledge gained from past learning experiences makes later learning faster or more effective, within the same area or in related areas. It is also called meta-learning and involves carrying forward useful information or strategies so new but similar tasks can be learned more easily.",
